<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Georgia:wght@400;700&amp;family=Times+New+Roman:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap');

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            max-width: 800px;
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
            line-height: 1.4;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #111;
            background: #fff;
        }

        /* Header / title block */
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .title {
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .date {
            font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* Main text content */
        .content {
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            line-height: 1.55;
        }

        .content p {
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .content strong {
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* Bullet list */
        .content ul {
            margin: 12px 0 20px 0;
            padding-left: 25px;
        }

        .content li {
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        /* Tables */
        .table-container {
            margin: 20px 0;
            border: 1px solid #aaa;
            width: 100%;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        .content table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .content th,
        .content td {
            border: 1px solid #999;
            padding: 6px 8px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .content th {
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* Signature / placeholder block */
        .signature {
            margin-top: 40px;
            border-top: 2px solid #555;
            padding-top: 15px;
            width: 280px;
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
        }

        .signature p {
            margin: 6px 0;
        }

        /* Footer line */
        .footer {
            margin-top: 50px;
            border-top: 1px dashed #888;
            padding-top: 10px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #555;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <div class="title">SAMPLE DOCUMENT TITLE</div>
        <div class="date">Month DD, YYYY</div>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <p>Paragraph one begins here and continues across multiple lines. This text is set in standard serif font to match the original document's body text style. The layout uses justified alignment with consistent margins on both sides.</p>

        <p>Second paragraph follows immediately. Notice the paragraph spacing of approximately 14 pixels between blocks for visual separation.</p>

        <p>Third paragraph with <strong>bold emphasis</strong> applied to a key word. This demonstrates how the converter preserves inline formatting.</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Bullet point one appears exactly as it would in a standard document list.</li>
            <li>Second bullet point is indented relative to the paragraph margin.</li>
            <li>Third bullet with <strong>bold text</strong> inside the list item.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Fourth paragraph continues the flow.</p>

        <!-- Table placeholder -->
        <div class="table-container">
            <table>
                <tr>
                    <th>Column 1 Header</th>
                    <th>Column 2 Header</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Row 1, Cell 1</td>
                    <td>Row 1, Cell 2</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Row 2, Cell 1</td>
                    <td>Row 2, Cell 2</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <p>Table placed here with borders matching the original document style.</p>

        <!-- Signature block -->
        <div class="signature">
            <p>Signature line</p>
            <p>_____________________________</p>
            <p>John Doe</p>
            <p>President</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        Footer text with page number or document identifier if present.
    </div>
</body>
</html>
